5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should be careful about the space. I'd like to look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree that data is necessary. I will look into the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually helping! I'll check the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs over three seasons. I want to see why things get delayed!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure our budget isn't leaking into invisible corners, I shall examine the mount-making charges and joiner's rate, as well as the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since everyone has selected their areas of inquiry, I believe we have a comprehensive spread of data to review.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I agree! I can't wait to see what we find out. It's going to be like a treasure hunt for the museum!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, do you think we've missed anything? I just want to make sure we aren't ignoring any other reasons why the doors might not open on time.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I believe we have covered the primary logistical and financial blind spots, Kenji. Let us proceed and see what the records actually reveal.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
