18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm over as well. Let's get to the results!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall also conclude my turn. I look forward to analyzing the data with you all.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
